# Exponential Desktop's factory taskbar (#EDE-48): Mint's grouped window list as a 48 px top layer
# surface along the whole bottom edge (#EDE-65: the shell opens it before the sidebar, so the 56 px
# rail stands on it). Bottom-left, under the rail: the Exponential start button (the start menu,
# start-menu.express anchored here), the Assistant button (the Exponential app's Assistant window, ede_chat) and the new-issue button right of it
# (the Exponential app's new issue, ede_launch {new: issue}), the IDE's ghost icon buttons. Then one
# icon-only 40 px button per app (/shell/taskbar/buttons: the pinned apps first, then the running
# ones), a dot under a running app, a wider one under the focused app, dimmed when every window is
# minimized; a click does what Mint's does (#EDE-254, grouped-window-list's defaults; ede_taskbar:
# launch, else focus the group's last focused window, or minimize it while it has the focus), the
# middle button closes that window (ede_taskbar_input, Box auxPress), a group of two or more windows
# wears its window count top-left (/shell/taskbar/buttons/*/count) and an app with desktop
# notifications their count top-right; #EDE-255: a group whose window asks for attention (X11 urgency, a
# refused activation) wears the demands-attention highlight, flashing first (/shell/taskbar/buttons/*/urgentLit,
# shell.json's urgentLit), until a focus answers it; the context menu is Cinnamon's (the shell builds each group's
# /shell/taskbar/buttons/*/menu, shell.json's taskbarMenu: monitor and workspace moves, Applet
# preferences, Recent, the desktop entry's actions, "Pinned to the taskbar" (a checkbox row),
# Restore/Minimize, Maximize/Unmaximize, Close others and Close all or Close; ede_taskbar_menu),
# hovering a running app opens
# its previews as a popup (a hosted Popover: live thumbnails of the group's windows from /previews, a
# click focuses; each thumbnail heads with its window's icon and title, Cinnamon's: an app's icon, and
# for the Exponential app's windows, #EDE-237, every page its own window, the page's concept icon the
# holder tells over the session bus). Right: the applets (network, sound, Bluetooth, battery: each opens its popup
# document anchored here, #EDE-43), the tray items, Needs you (#EDE-65: only while something waits on
# the person across the signed-in accounts' teams, /needsYou/count as its badge, or
# this install waits for approval, /installs/waiting, #EDE-226; it opens needs-you.express), Agent spaces (#EXP-2024: only while an agent space exists on this machine,
# /spaces/count; its hosted Popover lists /spaces/rows: each space's picture, its session's title (a
# child's chat as the second line, `Agent space n` for a session no signed-in account holds) and
# Close, which ends the space and never its session (ede_space_close); a press on a row pins that
# session's view, space-view.express (ede_space); a hosted Popover never takes the keyboard), the bell
# (notification-center.express: the desktop's notifications and the accounts' unread inbox merged) and
# the clock (#EXP-2046: in tabular figures, so its width holds from minute to minute and nothing left
# of it moves: an open popover anchored there stays open).
# #EDE-252: every menu of the panel is ONE genUI Menu, Cinnamon's panel menus: icons, separators, a
# checkmark row for a state, the keyboard (the menu takes it while open), opening off the panel's edge
# into the screen (above this bottom panel, kept on the output). A right click on an app (its group
# menu), on Start (Settings, Version history: ede_panel_menu), on the clock (Date and time
# settings, Cinnamon's calendar applet) or on a tray item opens one; a tray item's menu is its dbusmenu (/tray/*/menu, read
# again while the pointer is on it); a left click activates it, or opens the same menu for an item
# that is only a menu (ItemIsMenu, or an AppIndicator: /tray/*/menuOnPress), as Cinnamon's tray does.
# #EDE-247: a tray slot is Cinnamon's applet box: the icon 24 px (a symbolic one 16 px, centred; the
# shell draws it at the output's device size, tray_icon.rs), 5 px either side, the hover colour while
# hovered or pressed; the middle button = SecondaryActivate, a right click on an item without a menu =
# ContextMenu, the wheel = Scroll (ede_tray_input, Box auxPress / scroll).
# #EDE-245: the right side in Cinnamon's order (Mint 22's enabled-applets): the status icons (the tray, then
# Bluetooth, Needs you and Agent spaces as status icons), notifications (hidden while empty, Cinnamon's
# showEmptyTray false), printers (only while CUPS lists one), removable drives (only while one is mounted),
# network, sound, power, the clock, then the corner bar: a thin strip at the very end that shows the
# desktop (ede_show_desktop, Muffin's toggle_desktop).
# #EDE-253: the keyboard applet (keyboard@cinnamon.org) left of the network one, only with more than one
# layout (/keyboard/show): the active layout's short label (us, de), its menu the layouts (the active one
# checked; a pick switches: ede_keyboard_layout) and Keyboard settings.
# #EDE-239: the session area, a Cinnamon applet first on the right, before the status icons, only while
# a session runs or waits (/sessions/count): THE IDE sidebar's Active band (uicore shell.json sessionArea
# over the holder's `sessions`, the band's order), up to three chips (the agent mark, the title, a spinner
# while it runs, the attention dot while it needs you), then `+N`. A left click opens its panel
# (sessions-panel.express anchored here: per session the trace, Stop, the waiting card's answers in place,
# Open), a right click the applet menu (All chats, Needs you: ede_sessions {menu}).
surface("taskbar", extensions={ede: {layer: "top", anchor: ["bottom", "left", "right"], size: {height: 48}, exclusiveZone: 48, functions: ["ede_taskbar", "ede_taskbar_input", "ede_taskbar_menu", "ede_previews", "ede_focus", "ede_close", "ede_tray", "ede_tray_input", "ede_tray_menu", "ede_panel_menu", "ede_keyboard_layout", "ede_start_menu", "ede_chat", "ede_launch", "ede_space", "ede_space_close", "ede_show_desktop", "ede_sessions"]}})
$/applets/battery/icon = "ede-battery"
$/applets/battery/show = false
$/applets/bluetooth/show = false
$/applets/drives/show = false
$/applets/network/icon = "ede-wifi"
$/applets/printers/show = false
$/applets/sound/icon = "media-volume-up"
$/installs/waiting = false
$/keyboard/items = []
$/keyboard/label = ""
$/keyboard/open = false
$/keyboard/show = false
$/needsYou/count = 0
$/sessions/chips = []
$/sessions/count = 0
$/sessions/more = 0
$/sessions/moreLabel = ""
$/notifications/count = 0
$/previews/app = null
$/previews/windows = []
$/shell/taskbar/buttons = []
$/spaces/count = 0
$/spaces/rows = []
$/spacesList/open = false
$/time = "00:00"
$/tray = []
root = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "space-between", height: 48, paddingLeft: "$spacing.sm", paddingRight: "$spacing.sm", backgroundColor: "$color.background"}, children=[left, right])
left = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="sm", align="center", children=[corner, buttons])
corner = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=[start_menu, chat, new])
start_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}, {label: "Version history", value: "history", icon: "ui-history"}], openOn="contextmenu", children=[start], on={select: Event("ede_panel_menu")})
start = Button(label="Start", icon="brand-exponential", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_start_menu(toggle=true)}, style={width: 40, height: 40})
chat = Button(label="Assistant", icon="action-chat", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_chat()}, style={width: 40, height: 40})
new = Button(label="New issue", icon="nav-create-issue", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_launch(new="issue")}, style={width: 40, height: 40})
buttons = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=_template($/shell/taskbar/buttons, group, key="app"))
group = Menu(items=$menu, open=$menuOpen, side="top", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[previews], on={select: Event("ede_taskbar_menu", {app: $app})})
previews = Popover(side="top", align="center", openOn="hover", children=[previews_box], slots={trigger: "button"}, on={change: Event("ede_previews", {app: $app})})
previews_box = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="sm", align="start", style={padding: "$spacing.sm"}, children=_template($/previews/windows, preview, key="id"))
preview = Box(style={position: "relative", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xs", padding: "$spacing.xs", width: 200, borderRadius: "$radius.md"}, pressable=true, children=[preview_bg, preview_head, preview_thumb], on={press: ede_focus(window=$id)})
preview_bg = Box(style={position: "absolute", inset: 0, borderRadius: "$radius.md", backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}, visible=cond(if=$focused, then=true, else=false))
preview_head = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=[preview_page_icon, preview_app_icon, preview_title, preview_close])
preview_page_icon = Icon(name=$concept, size="sm", visible=cond(if=$page, then=true, else=false))
preview_app_icon = Image(src=$icon, alt=$title, fit="contain", width=16, height=16, fallback="nav-apps", visible=not(value=cond(if=$page, then=true, else=false)))
preview_title = Text(text=$title, variant="caption", lines=1, style={flexGrow: 1, minWidth: 0})
preview_close = Button(label="Close", icon="ui-close", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_close(window=$id)})
preview_thumb = Image(src=$thumbnail, alt=$title, fit="contain", width=184, height=110, fallback="ede-window")
button = Box(style={position: "relative", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: "$radius.md"}, pressable=true, children=[focus_bg, urgent_bg, button_icon, button_icon_dim, running_focused, running, not_running, window_count, notification_count], on={press: ede_taskbar(app=$app), auxPress: Event("ede_taskbar_input", {app: $app})})
focus_bg = Box(style={position: "absolute", inset: 0, borderRadius: "$radius.md", backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}, visible=cond(if=$focused, then=true, else=false))
urgent_bg = Box(style={position: "absolute", inset: 0, borderRadius: "$radius.md", backgroundColor: "$color.destructive", opacity: 0.8}, visible=cond(if=$urgentLit, then=true, else=false))
button_icon = Image(src=$icon, alt=$name, fit="contain", width=24, height=24, fallback="nav-apps", visible=not(value=cond(if=$minimized, then=true, else=false)))
button_icon_dim = Image(src=$icon, alt=$name, fit="contain", width=24, height=24, fallback="nav-apps", style={opacity: 0.5}, visible=cond(if=$minimized, then=true, else=false))
running_focused = Box(style={height: 2, width: 20, marginTop: 3, borderRadius: "$radius.full", backgroundColor: "$color.primary"}, visible=cond(if=$focused, then=true, else=false))
running = Box(style={height: 2, width: 8, marginTop: 3, borderRadius: "$radius.full", backgroundColor: "$color.mutedForeground"}, visible=and(values=[cond(if=$running, then=true, else=false), not(value=cond(if=$focused, then=true, else=false))]))
not_running = Box(style={height: 2, marginTop: 3}, visible=not(value=cond(if=$running, then=true, else=false)))
window_count = Box(style={position: "absolute", top: 0, left: 0}, children=[window_count_badge], visible=lt(a=1, b=$count))
window_count_badge = CountBadge(count=$count, tone="muted")
notification_count = Box(style={position: "absolute", top: 0, right: 0}, children=[notification_count_badge], visible=lt(a=0, b=$notifications))
notification_count_badge = CountBadge(count=$notifications, tone="attention")
right = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=[sessions, tray, tray_entry, applet_bluetooth, needs_you, needs_you_count, agent_spaces, bell, bell_count, applet_printers, applet_drives, applet_keyboard, applet_network, applet_sound, applet_battery, session, corner_bar])
tray = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=_template($/tray, tray_entry, key="service"))
tray_entry = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center"}, children=[tray_item, tray_menu])
tray_item = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", width: 34, height: 40, borderRadius: "$radius.md", ":hover": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}, ":pressed": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}}, pressable=true, children=[tray_icon], on={press: ede_tray(service=$service), auxPress: Event("ede_tray_input", {service: $service}), scroll: Event("ede_tray_input", {service: $service})}, visible=not(value=cond(if=$hasMenu, then=true, else=false)))
tray_icon = Image(src=$icon, alt=$title, fit="contain", width=24, height=24, fallback="nav-apps")
tray_menu = Menu(items=$menu, openOn="contextmenu", children=[tray_menu_target], on={select: Event("ede_tray_menu", {service: $service})}, visible=cond(if=$hasMenu, then=true, else=false))
tray_menu_target = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center"}, children=[tray_menu_press, tray_activate])
tray_activate = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", width: 34, height: 40, borderRadius: "$radius.md", ":hover": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}, ":pressed": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}}, pressable=true, children=[tray_activate_icon], on={press: ede_tray(service=$service), hover: ede_tray(service=$service, refresh=true), auxPress: Event("ede_tray_input", {service: $service}), scroll: Event("ede_tray_input", {service: $service})}, visible=not(value=cond(if=$menuOnPress, then=true, else=false)))
tray_activate_icon = Image(src=$icon, alt=$title, fit="contain", width=24, height=24, fallback="nav-apps")
tray_menu_press = Menu(items=$menu, side="top", align="end", children=[tray_menu_button], on={select: Event("ede_tray_menu", {service: $service})}, visible=cond(if=$menuOnPress, then=true, else=false))
tray_menu_button = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", width: 34, height: 40, borderRadius: "$radius.md", ":hover": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}, ":pressed": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}}, pressable=true, children=[tray_menu_icon], on={hover: ede_tray(service=$service, refresh=true), auxPress: Event("ede_tray_input", {service: $service}), scroll: Event("ede_tray_input", {service: $service})})
tray_menu_icon = Image(src=$icon, alt=$title, fit="contain", width=24, height=24, fallback="nav-apps")
applet_keyboard = Menu(items=$/keyboard/items, open=$/keyboard/open, side="top", align="end", children=[applet_keyboard_button], on={select: Event("ede_keyboard_layout")}, visible=cond(if=$/keyboard/show, then=true, else=false))
applet_keyboard_button = Button(label=$/keyboard/label, variant="ghost", size="sm")
applet_network = Button(label="Network", icon=$/applets/network/icon, variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("applet")})
applet_sound = Button(label="Sound", icon=$/applets/sound/icon, variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("applet")})
applet_bluetooth = Button(label="Bluetooth", icon="ede-bluetooth", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("applet")}, visible=cond(if=$/applets/bluetooth/show, then=true, else=false))
applet_printers = Button(label="Printers", icon="printer", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("applet")}, visible=cond(if=$/applets/printers/show, then=true, else=false))
applet_drives = Button(label="Removable drives", icon="hard-drive", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("applet")}, visible=cond(if=$/applets/drives/show, then=true, else=false))
applet_battery = Button(label="Battery", icon=$/applets/battery/icon, variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("applet")}, visible=cond(if=$/applets/battery/show, then=true, else=false))
needs_you = Button(label="Needs you", icon="nav-needs-you", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("needs_you")}, visible=or(values=[not(value=eq(a=$/needsYou/count, b=0)), cond(if=$/installs/waiting, then=true, else=false)]))
needs_you_count = CountBadge(count=$/needsYou/count, tone="attention", visible=not(value=eq(a=$/needsYou/count, b=0)))
agent_spaces = Popover(open=$/spacesList/open, side="top", align="end", children=[spaces_box], slots={trigger: "agent_spaces_button"}, visible=not(value=eq(a=$/spaces/count, b=0)))
spaces_box = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.sm", padding: "$spacing.sm", width: 380}, children=[spaces_title, spaces_scroll])
spaces_title = Heading(text="Agent spaces", level="h4")
spaces_scroll = ScrollArea(maxHeight=300, children=[spaces_list, space_row])
spaces_list = List(gap="none", divided=true, children=_template($/spaces/rows, space_row, key="id"))
space_row = Row(title=$title, subtitle=$subtitle, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={leading: "space_picture", trailing: "space_close"}, on={press: ede_space(session=$session)})
space_picture = Image(src=$picture, alt=$title, fit="contain", width=96, height=60, fallback="nav-computer")
space_close = Button(label="Close", icon="ui-close", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_space_close(space=$id)})
agent_spaces_button = Button(label="Agent spaces", icon="nav-computer", variant="ghost", size="icon")
bell = Button(label="Notifications", icon="nav-notifications", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("bell")}, visible=not(value=eq(a=$/notifications/count, b=0)))
bell_count = CountBadge(count=$/notifications/count, tone="muted", visible=not(value=eq(a=$/notifications/count, b=0)))
session = Menu(items=[{label: "Date and time settings", value: "datetime", icon: "ui-clock"}], openOn="contextmenu", children=[clock], on={select: Event("ede_panel_menu")})
clock = Button(label=$/time, variant="ghost", size="sm", on={press: Event("clock")}, style={fontVariantNumeric: "tabular-nums"})
corner_bar = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "flex-end", width: 12, height: 48}, pressable=true, children=[corner_line], on={press: ede_show_desktop()})
corner_line = Box(style={width: 1, height: 24, backgroundColor: "$color.border"})
sessions = Menu(items=[{label: "All chats", value: "chats", icon: "nav-chats"}, {label: "Needs you", value: "needs-you", icon: "nav-needs-you"}], side="top", align="end", openOn="contextmenu", children=[sessions_box], on={select: ede_sessions(menu=$value)}, visible=not(value=eq(a=$/sessions/count, b=0)))
sessions_box = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 4, height: 40, paddingLeft: 4, paddingRight: 4, borderRadius: "$radius.md", ":hover": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}, ":pressed": {backgroundColor: "$color.accent"}}, pressable=true, children=[sessions_chips, sessions_more], on={press: Event("sessions")})
sessions_chips = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=_template($/sessions/chips, session_chip, key="id"))
session_chip = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 6, height: 32, paddingLeft: 8, paddingRight: 10, maxWidth: 200, borderRadius: "$radius.md", borderWidth: 1, borderColor: "$color.border", backgroundColor: "$color.card"}, children=[session_chip_icon, session_chip_title, session_chip_spinner, session_chip_needs])
session_chip_icon = Icon(name=$icon, size="sm")
session_chip_title = Text(text=$title, variant="caption", lines=1, style={minWidth: 0})
session_chip_spinner = Spinner(size="xs", visible=cond(if=$running, then=true, else=false))
session_chip_needs = Box(style={width: 8, height: 8, flexShrink: 0, borderRadius: "$radius.full", backgroundColor: "$color.warning"}, visible=cond(if=$needs, then=true, else=false))
sessions_more = Box(style={display: "flex", alignItems: "center", height: 32, paddingLeft: 8, paddingRight: 8, borderRadius: "$radius.md", borderWidth: 1, borderColor: "$color.border", backgroundColor: "$color.card"}, children=[sessions_more_label], visible=not(value=eq(a=$/sessions/more, b=0)))
sessions_more_label = Text(text=$/sessions/moreLabel, variant="caption")
